            # composer's inline fallback byte-for-byte (its documented
            # FALLBACK/PARITY guarantee for the unfocused path); the DEPBOD
            # uuid set moves from the legacy body_suppressed_ids side channel
            # to the policy's deprecated cause -- the composer folds either
