        # already adopted on the full-document render that preceded the row
        # click), but echoing it keeps every render reply's shape uniform so any
        # consumer can treat them identically. Holds ONLY normalized structured
        # fields; the footer composes any human string from them.
        # RESOLVED render_spec: the ONE incoming_spec refined with the
        # RESOLVED scope -- canonical group id/name, the actually-resolved
        # projection root_uuid, and the opaque lightning selection echo -- so
        # render_scope is composed FROM the same spec the projection ran on
        # (invariants 3 + 4). The kind is set EXPLICITLY from the handler's
        # authoritative cell booleans rather than inherited from the incoming
        # frame, because the SLICE cell can fall back to the ACTIVE group when
