            # row DOWN to the end of the render order -- exactly the
            # since='last N' value to keep 'this row and everything below it'.
            # Computed over the SAME final render_tree, single-sourced on
            # collect_leaf_branches (the one leaf definition 'last N' counts).
            # None on an unresolvable focus -> the client simply omits the
