# The estate is the set of views a session stands in: the Tier-0 export
# payload ([{alias, title, url, spec}, ...]) held in an ordinary AP note,
# consumable by an agent BY HANDLE with no tab and no modal ([ap:KORN3Z]
# §3(a)). This region is ORCHESTRATION ONLY: parsing is the pure
# glimpse_estate_payload module; rendering is the EXISTING funnel
# (from_render_spec_blob → the one normalizer → _glimpse_dispatch_spec →
# projection → the one composer). No new render kind, no new composer path,
# no wire change ([ap:LLBHG5] R4).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

