            returns={"description":"The same return shapes and modal lifecycle as slice_group.render: raw Markdown by default, the structured result when as_markdown=false. The lens's ancestor path above the input roots renders heading-only by default (document order included); ancestor_notes=true restores those notes. A legitimately empty result is delivered as the literal string '(empty)', never a bare blank string (the public funnel's empty-output stub)."},
