                    "the eligible rows AFTER this page, has_more says whether any remain, and next_offset is offset + returned rows when has_more, otherwise null. "
                    "Missing requested ids are missing_finding_ids against ALL findings, independent of filters; absence does not mean fixed. "
                    "scope_fingerprint is SHA-256 of canonical JSON of sorted file observations (canonical_file plus file_sha256 or explicit unreadable/missing identity), "
                    "including clean and marker-free files. Pages are stateless: compare fingerprints and restart if changed; there is no stored cursor or lease. "
                    "A CLOSE-ID TYPO shows as two rows together, span_without_close on the opener and orphan_close on the close (MasterSpec R3): both rows are info; "
                    "list them with min_severity: 'info'. Every structural close, including incomplete, adjacent and orphan candidates, is examined; mentions in code/prose are not closes. "
                    "FOLDER COVERAGE: a FOLDER or Root: check covers exactly the FILE nodes the current map lists beneath the node (T3.1/T3.2): "
